/* TAL1: case of jmp, slight modification: 
   added the two extra cases 'TypeOfW-VarL : case TypeOfVarL' and 'LookupVarL : case TypeOfW-VarL'
   to derive a lookup formula from typing a label, which Find-type-in-env-byLookupH works with. 
   two cases because typeOfV goes through typeOfW because releasing the lookup formula. */

Beginsjmp: apply Step. 
